<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Churchill returns about three and a half months after his stroke. He has been back at full days of work for two weeks and is preparing a major speech later this week. He finished physical and occupational therapy two weeks ago. He walks without a stick, writes normally, and his speech no longer slurs, though his left hand is slightly less nimble when he is tired. He has had no falls, lightheadedness, or new neurological symptoms. His mood is good and he rarely becomes tearful. He smokes about three cigars a day and drinks two or three drinks on most days. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Interval change</td><td>Full work for two weeks; therapy completed</td></tr><tr><td>Function</td><td>No stick; normal writing and speech; mild left hand fatigue</td></tr><tr><td>Upcoming</td><td>A long speech later this week</td></tr><tr><td>Tobacco and alcohol</td><td>About three cigars a day; two or three drinks on most days</td></tr><tr><td>Mood</td><td>Good; rarely tearful</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

